# Build output, all of it at the repository root. The leading slashes are
# load-bearing: a pattern without one matches at every depth, and a bare
# `wanctl` therefore also matched android/java/dev/wanctl/agent/ — which
# silently kept the entire Android app out of the repository.
/wanctl
/wanctl.exe
/bin/
/release/
/build/
/artifacts/
.DS_Store
